## File Naming Conventions

- Handlers: `handler_[action].go` (e.g., `handler_register_with_google_oauth.go`)
- UseCases: `usecase_[action].go` (e.g., `usecase_register_user.go`)
- Repositories: `repository_[action].go` (e.g., `repository_create_user.go`)
- Routes: `routes.go` (one per feature)
- Main struct: `handler.go`, `usecase.go`, `repository.go`

